{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:3a731001dd439b71","name":"Vo'ren's Fifth Cadence","source":{"id":"source:reference-3a731001dd439b71","title":"Vo'ren's Fifth Cadence","revision":20568,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:06:06Z","sha256":"8a4963b154ae60bcb3a1dfd618683b90ec09c1aca7f3b2711ed0b83070c4d179","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20568","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Vo%27ren%27s%20Fifth%20Cadence&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-3a731001dd439b71","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In Vo'ren's fifth and final cadence, you must demonstrate true mastery over yourself and your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},". No wax cylinders are required; you simply know when you have made a correct strike. Unlike the other cadences, this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Regimen"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Regimen"}," requires you to use ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," to manipulate your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},", an act of pure telekinetic power in which your hands never touch the weapon. This technique brings together the Control, Sense, and Alter aspects of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," into one training regimen.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Time:"]}," 3 Hours\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Targets:"]}," Self\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Requirements:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check."]}," You take a penalty on your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check equal to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},". The result of the check determines the benefits of the regimen:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DC\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["EFFECT\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["31\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You make a mistake during the first hour. You gain a +1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," checks made to use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Light Object"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Light_Object"}," application of the skill.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["37\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You make a mistake during the second hour. You gain a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," checks made to use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Light Object"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Light_Object"}," application of the skill.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["43\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You complete the cadence without making a single mistake. You gain a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," checks made to use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Light Object"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Light_Object"}," application of the skill, and you add the ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Kinetic Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kinetic_Combat","referenceId":"reference:5f2b444e44f57d4e"}]}," Force Power to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power Suite"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power_Suite"},". Additionally, you can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to reroll any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check made to activate a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," with the [",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Telekinetic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Telekinetic"}]},"] descriptor, keeping the better of the two results.\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
